{
  "info": {
    "name": "Teacolito API",
    "description": "Coleccion end-to-end del backend Teacolito, a traves del API Gateway (nginx). Corre las carpetas en orden de arriba hacia abajo con el Collection Runner. Requiere dos usuarios de prueba reales de Cognito configurados en el environment (user_a_username/password, user_b_username/password) con ALLOW_USER_PASSWORD_AUTH habilitado en el App Client. El nombre del grupo se genera con timestamp, asi que se puede correr varias veces sin choques de nombre duplicado entre corridas. MODO SEMBRAR DATOS (para dejar la base poblada antes de la evaluacion): en el Collection Runner, deselecciona la carpeta 'Cleanup & group lifecycle' y corre el resto 2-3 veces -- asi quedan varios grupos/gastos/pagos reales sin borrarse. MODO CICLO COMPLETO (para demostrar en la defensa): corre TODAS las carpetas, incluida Cleanup, que borra lo que creo esa corrida (demuestra el bloqueo de DELETE por balance pendiente y el borrado exitoso una vez saldado).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login User A",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var CryptoJS = require('crypto-js');",
                  "var message = pm.environment.get('user_a_username') + pm.environment.get('cognito_client_id');",
                  "var hash = CryptoJS.HmacSHA256(message, pm.environment.get('cognito_client_secret'));",
                  "pm.environment.set('secret_hash_a', CryptoJS.enc.Base64.stringify(hash));"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.AuthenticationResult) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('access_token_a', json.AuthenticationResult.AccessToken);",
                  "    pm.test('AccessToken saved', function () { pm.expect(json.AuthenticationResult.AccessToken).to.be.a('string'); });",
                  "} else if (json.ChallengeName === 'NEW_PASSWORD_REQUIRED') {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('cognito_session_a', json.Session);",
                  "    console.warn('User A needs a permanent password: run \"Complete New Password Challenge - User A\" once, then re-run this login.');",
                  "} else {",
                  "    throw new Error('Unexpected Cognito response: ' + pm.response.text());",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-amz-json-1.1" },
              { "key": "X-Amz-Target", "value": "AWSCognitoIdentityProviderService.InitiateAuth" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"AuthFlow\": \"USER_PASSWORD_AUTH\",\n  \"ClientId\": \"{{cognito_client_id}}\",\n  \"AuthParameters\": {\n    \"USERNAME\": \"{{user_a_username}}\",\n    \"PASSWORD\": \"{{user_a_password}}\",\n    \"SECRET_HASH\": \"{{secret_hash_a}}\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://cognito-idp.{{cognito_region}}.amazonaws.com/",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": ["cognito-idp", "{{cognito_region}}", "amazonaws", "com"],
              "path": [""]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Complete New Password Challenge - User A",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var CryptoJS = require('crypto-js');",
                  "var message = pm.environment.get('user_a_username') + pm.environment.get('cognito_client_id');",
                  "var hash = CryptoJS.HmacSHA256(message, pm.environment.get('cognito_client_secret'));",
                  "pm.environment.set('secret_hash_a', CryptoJS.enc.Base64.stringify(hash));"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('AuthenticationResult present', function () { pm.expect(json.AuthenticationResult).to.have.property('AccessToken'); });",
                  "pm.environment.set('access_token_a', json.AuthenticationResult.AccessToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-amz-json-1.1" },
              { "key": "X-Amz-Target", "value": "AWSCognitoIdentityProviderService.RespondToAuthChallenge" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"ChallengeName\": \"NEW_PASSWORD_REQUIRED\",\n  \"ClientId\": \"{{cognito_client_id}}\",\n  \"Session\": \"{{cognito_session_a}}\",\n  \"ChallengeResponses\": {\n    \"USERNAME\": \"{{user_a_username}}\",\n    \"NEW_PASSWORD\": \"{{user_a_password}}\",\n    \"SECRET_HASH\": \"{{secret_hash_a}}\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://cognito-idp.{{cognito_region}}.amazonaws.com/",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": ["cognito-idp", "{{cognito_region}}", "amazonaws", "com"],
              "path": [""]
            },
            "description": "Correr UNA SOLA VEZ por usuario, solo si 'Login User A' capturo un ChallengeName NEW_PASSWORD_REQUIRED en vez de un token. Deja la password ya usada como permanente; los logins siguientes no necesitan este paso."
          }
        },
